  "Wowhead050you can find Orweyna on a hill behind the toymaker, she is not in the building in the Den. 54.19, 55.33 Last edited by joxie on 2026/03/07 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Need to be level 90 for this quest to unlock Appears that you need to have One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar completed to see the storylines: A Goblin in Harandar Cultivating Hope Bloomtown I saw them at level 88 after completing the main story of Harandar Last edited by Hanolas on 2026/03/01 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Can be turned in / way 47.15 45.85",
  "Wowhead050This became available after completing either Light Repurposed or Infusion of Hope in the Arator's Journey story. Not sure which one triggered it but I checked the map frequently and it was one or the other. The Midnight achievment unlocks it as well. Last edited by Barovian on 2026/02/28 (Patch 12.0.1)",
},

