[90549] = {
  "9054918080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Quest was bugged for me. I could not see the last item, so stuck on 5/ 6. Dropped the quest and once I picked it up again, six items were correctly displayed on my minimap. Bingo!",
  "Wowhead050Can't collect any of these, no addons. Bugged and reported.",
  "Wowhead050The quest was not bugged for me. If you set focus on it, there are circles on your minimap, indicating where each of the weapon is in the area. They are on the ground, 1 was inside. I was able to pick all six of them up and turn in the quest. Might have been fixed in the meanwhile, might be a case of experiences may vary. The future will tell.",
},

