[90551] = {
  "9055118080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Only one person can click him. So if multiple people are doing the quest (and are not in the same group), then good luck clicking him first",
  "Wowhead050Capture him, then bring him to / way 41.61, 72.09 (just south of where you captured him). Last edited by Rubel on 2026/03/10 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Fun Fact Once you capture this guy he'll follow you absolutely everywhere. Just did a full run of weeklies and preyseeking in each zone with him helping. Gonna miss him when I hand this in.",
  "Wowhead050Love these quests that bottle-neck players and keep them competing against each other. For a story quest objective. Barf.",
  "Wowhead050ive had mine captured for a week, he does damage in M dungeons but will sometimes pull adds, ill try to avoid the turn in to see how long he lasts",
  "Wowhead050Was bugged for me today and couldn't drop him off, had to abandon and then redo it.",
},

