[90735] = {
  "9073518080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Been stuck waiting to do this quest for two weeks, main cant do the haranir weekly. Bricked it seems",
  "Wowhead050So after attempting to get help from Blizzard, I was essentially told \"Can't help you, go away\" by a GM in the language that they are allowed to use. I was given a link TO THIS ARTICLE, that I had already referred to in my ticket. One GM claimed that there were no bug reports filed - there are multiple. I've tried all of these solutions, I tried everything the first GM told me to try - which included a suggestion of ABANDONING the quest and retaking it - when the whole damn issue is I can't get the quest in the first place! I'm so unbelievably pissed off",
  "Wowhead050This is broken! Can't do the last two relics and this quest is unavailable to me. Been like this for 2 weeks, no change. Bought a decor item from Maku for completing Wey'nan's Ward quest, now it says the item is unavailable because i haven't completed the quest even though i already bought the item once! Fun times.",
  "Wowhead050This quest isn't available to any of my toons. Progression with the weekly relics quests is currently stalled on the last two on the right telling me I need to awaken them by unlocking the other relics, but they already are. This set of quests and achievement seems to be confounding a lot of people with little to no help from bug reports and seemingly no desire to fix them. Either they're bugged or made in such a way that if you don't stick entirely to a particular format it blocks you from completion forever more with no way out. I can see the only way to save my sanity is to drop the lot and forget about it until someone decides to fix or get rid of these diabolically bad quests.",
  "Wowhead050This opened up for me after doing 5 relic quests on the same character.",
  "Wowhead050does anyone any idea how to get this quest? I am not getting it for third ( i think) week now. the GMs closed my ticket that they do not support this. i reported a bug, but i guess since it is working for someone, i guess i am missing something. I have finished all other available quests in Harandar, i use only one character... any idea? is there a renown requirement?",
  "Wowhead050Located above the Den in a hut at / way 53.15, 50.17",
  "Wowhead050Ok, I may have figured this out. I too was stuck and I went to see what quest I was missing in this chain. Apparently after the 2nd quest when drinking tea. If you talk to Aksem and follow chat bubbles, he mentions meditating at the cradle. Fly to top of ridge next to the skyriding glyph there (47, 53) there is a table with mag glass. Click it and meditate-once that is done you will have another quest pop up to meditate at a stone. Once that quest is done you turn it in to Kassameth and he will then give you the next quest, The Stolen Staff. Last edited by Anrika72 9 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
},

