[91492] = {
  "9149218080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050For stage 3 - Seeker Visions uncovered (3) - the third vision is inside the cave, but on the upper level which you get to via a tunnel on the left as you enter the cave.",
  "Wowhead050The Legend of Aln'hara The seekers did not cry out for the goddess's return. They listened, and waited, in the quiet places where memory clings. The creatures remembered where she had been. Some creatures still sang in harmony with her. Some creatures became consumed with gluttony, in order to fill the void created from her departure. The stones echoed her song, but this one was different. Within it the song stirred, yearning to share its tune. They followed not a path, but an echo of feeling. She was not in the light--she was the warmth it left behind. The seekers sat in silence. Even there, we heard her song. We called out with song. She did not answer. But something she left behind did. And it was enough. She did not return. But something of her remained, blooming in the silence for those who remembered. ******* The Gift of Promise We did not cry out for her return. Instead, we listened and waited, In the quiet places where her memory clings. We remembered where she had been. Some of us still sang in harmony with her, While others became consumed with a hollow hunger, Trying to fill the void her departure left behind. Even the stones echoed her song, but the tune had changed; Within the silence, the music stirred, yearning to be shared. We followed no map, no paved path, But an echo of feeling she left in the air. She was no longer in the light— She was the warmth that lingered after it faded. We sat in the stillness, and even then, we heard her. We called out with our own song. She did not answer. But the resonance she left behind did. And for us, it was enough. She did not return. But something of her remained, Blooming in the silence for those of us who remembered. Last edited by deadcat27 on 2026/03/07 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Если вы сделали все квесты по легендам хараниров и пытаетесь повторно выполнить данный квест, то вам после взаимодействия с табличкой нужно полностью выйти из клиента игры. / reload не помогает. После того как вновь зайдете в игру, квестовая цепочка завершается автоматически и ее можно сдать НПС, у которого квест принимался",
  "Wowhead050To complete the \"Learn about a Lengend of the Haranir in Harandar\" portion of Midnight: World Tour, you have to complete the quest Aln'hara's Bloom from Zur'ashar Kassameh in The Den. See screenshot for more details",
},

[91493] = {
  "9149318080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050If you are having trouble picking up this quest, you need to do the storyline that allows you to grab Slithering Closer first.",
  "Wowhead050i'm curious about the Vintage Vintage it says \"Elendar Reserve, 25\" i'm assuming that means the year 25 but what calendar is it referencing ? is year zero when the dark portal opened the first time (ADP) ? which would make the wine just a couple of decades old or since we're talking elves, maybe it's thousands of years old when the world sundered, or when Quel'Thalas was founded",
},

