[91542] = {
  "9154218080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Umbric got a laugh out of me. \"Here's this tea that will let you confront your inner demons\" \"Oh sure, let's see... oh, it's just doubt again. No, already dealt with that. Next!\"",
  "Wowhead050This quest's title is quite possibly a reference to the song 'The Town Inside Me', which is the theme of notable character 'Bridget' in the fighting game 'Guilty Gear: Strive'. This is supported by the titles of two other quests in this questline: Like a Weed , which is likely a reference to another song from 'Guilty Gear: Strive', 'Like a Weed, Naturally, as a Matter of Course', which is the theme of the character 'Testament'. Home Sweet Grave , which is likely a reference to an older Guilty Gear song of the same name.",
  "Wowhead050Someone at Blizzard is a Guilty Gear fan I see As a Bridget main this makes me happy :,) Best Girl",
  "Wowhead050And Everyone's Voice.",
  "Wowhead050Sideras seems to be bugged (at least Lordaeron/ Blackmoore EU Realm) you can not interact with him. E: After finishing the rest of the Quests, Sideras was interactable. Last edited by Mosur on 2026/03/01 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Not only is he bugged, the entire quest Layout seems flawed. The part of \"Sideras tea credit\" has no value, it's just descriptive in its code",
},

