  "Wowhead050this is the last quest in the quest chain not the first. start here: What We Leave Behind Last edited by bradweiser on 2026/03/01 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050How do I start this questchain? I'm at 58.18, 78.60 where the quest giver should be and no one's there on a lvl 90 character who completed the main story.",
  "Wowhead050If you're a blood elf, you get different quest text: That must be the monster that killed Hieron. It's tearing open a backdoor for the Void's forces to pour into Silvermoon. You're not like the people I left behind in Silvermoon, [name]. I'm doing this for Hieron. But if you want to save your city, I'll do it for you too. Signal Umbric. Let's do this. Together.",
},

