  "Wowhead050First at 51.36, 41.54 above between the trees Second 51.72, 39.54 behind the tree, third at 50.39, 40.77 behind the tree Last at 49.54, 43.10 behind the small tress",
  "Wowhead050For anyone else, this quest did not appear on my map to find Had to fly to 48.77, 44.32 where Shao'mal appeared and had the quest / way 48.77, 44.32 Shao'mal",
  "Wowhead050Cat form -> Track Humanoids You can hide, but you can't cover your smell... Last edited by Lunae067 on 2026/03/26 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050The orphans in Mereldar were much better hiders than these kids",
},

