[91555] = {
  "9155518080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050/ target Weary Defender / cleartarget [dead] / stopmacro [noexists][dead] / tm 8 / ping [@target] Makes life a bit easier.",
  "Wowhead050If you are finding that you can click on the Defenders but you don't receive credit, check if you are in a group. I forgot to leave the raid group from the nearby world boss and was able to channel the potion into the Defenders, but they would just run off and respawn in like 5 seconds without giving credit. As soon as I left the group I was able to get credit. Hope this helps someone.",
  "Wowhead050if like me, green dots are your thing... / way #2413 56.0 51.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 56.2 55.2 Weary Defender / way #2413 57.0 56.4 Weary Defender / way #2413 57.4 50.4 Weary Defender / way #2413 57.4 50.6 Weary Defender / way #2413 57.4 51.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 57.8 51.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 57.8 56.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 58.6 48.4 Weary Defender / way #2413 58.6 50.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 58.8 54.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 59.4 53.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 59.6 50.4 Weary Defender / way #2413 59.6 51.8 Weary Defender / way #2413 60.4 50.6 Weary Defender / way #2413 60.6 49.2 Weary Defender / way #2413 60.8 50.6 Weary Defender Last edited by mncristy 5 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
},

