[91566] = {
  "9156618080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050If you're looking for the quest giver, use the marker on the wowhead map. The in-game map incorrectly shows it on the flight master.",
  "Wowhead050So, you just found out this is part of Sojourner for Voidstorm and you came here to find out its the pvp subzone. *sits backwards in flying chair* Welcome to hell. Don't worry, you can do it all with Warmode off lol Last edited by apedosmil on 2026/02/28 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050/ way #2444 23.6 54.4 Ziadan",
  "Wowhead050The Alliance storyline starts here: Voidscar Arena: The Grief Spire",
  "Wowhead050\"Requires level 88\" - for anyone looking for the quest who can't find it, this is why. (3/ 1/ 2026)",
  "Wowhead050If anyone else is noticing the hand in for this quest at 51,57 (middle of the map) the actual hand in can be at Ziadan at 23.6 54.4. My in game marker was always showing an empty location, but it seems this NPC can be found in multiple locations. Other Ziadan locations Ziadan Main Location - Master's Perch / way 34, 80 Ziadan Possible Locations / way 51, 57 Path of Preditation / way 23.6, 54.4 Hate Spire / way 53, 21 Voidscar Arena / way 53, 11 Voidscar Arena Last edited by Aaylaa on 2026/03/05 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050If you are currently on Voidscar Area: The Hatespire & fly over to the bridge to turn your quest in, fear not as that is the wrong spot. I did this instead of reading & flew BACK to the Hate Spire & turned my quest in to Ziadan (23.54) and I NEVER had to enter war mode. I hate pvp so this made me happy & I hope this helps anyone that made the same mistake I did",
},

[91582] = {
  "9158218080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050What an awful world quest. Fills so slowly and I keep getting randomly exited out of the area.",
  "Wowhead050This actually gets my vote for one of the worst WQ. Need 100%, and each kill only gives 1-5%. Last edited by Vexikuri on 2026/03/25 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Best way for this quest is going to 53.69 27.82 and killing elite Petalchomper along with his two guards, killing him awards 20% to quest objective. Doing this three or more times will finish the world quest quickly, as the respawn is near instant and killing him is easy. If he's not spawned try searching the bridges nearby as he patrols on them. Last edited by Lemistio on 2026/04/02 (Patch 12.0.1)",
},

