[91693] = {
  "9169318080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050There is a bug that makes this quest impossible to finish. If you hand in the tokens to the nearby NPCs before starting the quest, you can get soft-locked. Because the NPCs only accept the tokens once, the quest does not count tokens that were already given to them before the quest began. Update: It is fixed after every reset. If you go to the NPC who gives the quest, you should be able to pick up a new quest that gives you 3 new tokens. That worked for me. Just make sure you have the quest The Subtle Game active when you give the tokens to the NPCs Last edited by Johasne on 2026/03/14 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050I found the solution . After the weekly reset I had no quests in my log. Lord Saltheril offers two quests — you must accept both: The Subtle Game Weekly Quest – choose a faction and receive 3 Saltheril’s Favors Choose a faction (e.g. Blood Knights) → receive 3 Favors. Turn the 3 Favors in at the factions to unlock a quest. Then return to Lord Saltheril and complete The Subtle Game. This unlocks the 246 helmet quest. Fly to the runestone, activate it, then return and collect the helmet.",
  "Wowhead050I gave the tokens before picking up this quest with my main. Tried to do the event anyway but i'm still not recieving the champion head quest. I'm locked with my alt aswell (finished the campaing but not of the previous quest appear on the map) Am I premanently locked out of the item of can I have another try on the next reset? Anyone knows how to solve this?",
  "Wowhead050Oh good, it's my least favorite part of Shadowlands copy-pasted.",
  "Wowhead050I opened a ticket for this quest and its still \"buggy\". The answer was pretty simple from the GM: Hello Gabimaru, this is Game Master Nizuzigu. Thank you for taking the time to contact us and bring this situation to our attention. I truly understand your frustration. I'm currently stuck myself. As much as we here in Customer Support want to help you, even we GMs have limits to our authority, and only our developers can resolve these issues. We need to be a little more patient while they fix the problem with this quest. It was a pleasure assisting you today. I hope you have a great day. If you have any further issues, please don't hesitate to contact us. Sincerely, GM Nizuzigu So - if you accept the quest and didnt receive the \"tokens\" of this quests its not your fault, its a bug. KR",
  "Wowhead050You can give more than 1 coin to the same court faction, which I tested this by giving 2 coins to the magisters followed by receiving 2 different daily quests from them.",
  "Wowhead050Due to a quest error, it is no longer possible to receive the quest for a helmet for 9 reputation. Why did I level it up? @Blizard",
  "Wowhead050Wanted your champion helmet for lvl 9 rep on week 1? Please wait for a month so small indie developer fixes it.",
},

[91694] = {
  "9169418080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Funnily enough, I got Sojourner/ Loremaster before even accepting this quest",
  "Wowhead050Hi all, just completed this. Yes it's needed for Sojourner of Voidstorm and No you don't have to be in PvP to complete it. Thanks!",
  "Wowhead050This sucks so bad! I have never pvp'd since starting WoW in 2007...and, as badly as this is going, I'll never get this done. 8^( IMHO, pvp activities shouldn't be a requirement for the sojourner achievement.",
  "Wowhead050Sorry if this sounds dumb, I am trying to complete this achievement, where do I pick up the quest?",
  "Wowhead050Copying the (currently) top rated comment from the \"Breaking the Triad\" Storyline YOU DO NOT HAVE TO DO THE PVP QUESTS TO GET LOREMASTER/ SOJOURNER OF VOIDSTORM! As a PvP-averse person (I have heart issues, it makes my blood pressure go up to unsafe levels), I was panicking when all the PvP-enabled, Warmode quests popped up from these guys. If you don't like PvP, GREAT NEWS, the quests for the achievement and this chain in total, do not require PvP at all! Fret not, people who disdain PvP as much as I do (though I'm happy PvP people have a new place to do their thing in!). Happy Trails! The PvE quests that start the questline to get the Sojourner / Loremaster achievement are: Alliance: Voidscar Arena: The Grief Spire / way #2444 40.8 84.0 Amari Lyndon Horde: Voidscar Arena: The Hate Spire / way #2444 34.8 80.6 Dar'gul Also, this dungeon quest as of May 2026 is OPTIONAL! I just finished the questline, and received both the Sojourner of Voidstorm and Loremaster achievements after turning in Voidscar Arena: Clearing House .",
  "Wowhead050So, what do you actually do for this quest? On entering the arena there is a large elite jellyfish (not called Charonus)",
},

[91700] = {
  "9170018080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050The rares will appear right after the Stormarion Assault. Two rares will spawn. If you miss one or both you'll have to wait until the next Assault is completed. After the Assault, fly around the area and look for the Silver arrows on your minimap that point the way.",
  "Wowhead050stupid quest in my opinion, but for anyone that is trying to find two different rare I can at least confirm you don't need to I got credit killing Blackcore twice",
  "Wowhead050I've been hanging around this area for 2+ hours and only seen one rare mob. This is a ridiculous BS quest. Not ever doing it again, because it's absolutely not worth the time for the rep or the gold.",
  "Wowhead050Deep Core is triggered. You need to click on the 3 altar things and spend an Unstable Focusing Crystal for each then he will spawn. Not sure about the other guy yet.",
  "Wowhead050Got invited to a group, did the whole thing but the quest \"Darkness Unmade\" doesn't track the rares as well as the entire event that allows me to collect the weekly \"Stormarion Assault\" doesn't work for me? (I'm fairly new so I'm not sure if I am doing something wrong here)",
  "Wowhead050While it is true that there seems to be two rare elites spawning right after the Stormarion event ( Could be just a coincidence ) there are also elites spawning besides around the event. Found one now, event ended about 6 minutes ago for me. Last edited by Alta87 on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050This quest is bugged. Did the assault twice, killed Blackcore twice and another rare once and haven't gotten credit for any! Blizz fix this! EDIT: Didn't credit the two rares I killed after the event today. I guess that was due to being in a raid group, as other comments indicate. But to the downvoters - shouldn't this be a bug? Last edited by Denebi on 2026/04/02 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Idiotic quest design. I accidentally killed the rares before doing the assault because I just thought they were regular zone rares, so now the game no longer shows them as rares on the minimap for me, nor does RareScanner alert about them. Because of that, I missed the other rare I needed to kill (no idea where they spawn) and now I need to wait for the next assault to finish before I get another shot at it.",
  "Wowhead050The rares will spawn after the Stormarion Assault event, which occurs every 30 minutes.",
},

