[91810] = {
  "9181018080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050The bag is sold by the repair vendor across the street.",
  "Wowhead050The skewers were leaning against the cookpot and didn't seem to show until I'd gotten everything else. The \"taste\" was another skewer leaning on a rock in front of Amaxi, another questgiver.",
  "Wowhead050In this order: Buy a Bag of Skewers from Repairer (Jol the Splintershell), then go to the Blisterskin Kelp red carpet looking thing next to Bubble Sealer Rik the alchemy vendor. Jump up and down (space bar) 8 times on the red carpet. Click the blue fish on the ground next to carpet (5 of 'em). The boars are dead on the ground too, in front of the cookpot x 6. Throw in cookpot (click on it), then click on the food on the ground to \"taste\" it. Profit.",
  "Wowhead050The Skewer is missing for me, picture attached UPdate, turned off my addons and bingo I got it Last edited by dburton 7 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
},

[91811] = {
  "9181118080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050The orb is on top of the temple",
  "Wowhead050Do not move while killing your mirror. Doing a step in the wrong direction resets the mirror and you have to start over.",
  "Wowhead050This is bugged, but completable! (Others please confirm for me, and others) You MUST stand still for the credit. As of 4-17-26.",
  "Wowhead050AS of 20-03-2026 this is bugged, killing it does not reward completion. Even taking the other tips of not moving in to account..",
  "Wowhead050As a Demon Hunter, of ANY kind, do NOT use any ability that changes your form. Whatsoever. I discovered that sure, Meta bugs it out... but ANYTHING that changes your form completely bugs it out. And you can bug it out when you summon the mirror image too. If that happens, just restart it and keep doing it until it goes hostile. So any ability whatsoever, even ones that change your form for a fraction of a second, will bug it out. As a Devourer, Void Nova which CREATES a visual effect of your character on the target... bugs it out. As does Void Ray. So as annoying as it is, do not use Meta, Void Nova or Void Ray as it will BUG OUT at 1% and despawn, without giving you credit. Seriously messed up crap this quest.",
  "Wowhead050Works 20% of the time, everytime!",
  "Wowhead050I touched the orb and it gave me an image of a player that was... definitely not me, to say the least. Especially when the image was of a dwarf while I was on a LF draenei. And then it randomly despawned while I fought it.",
  "Wowhead050When you click on the ball of fire a mirror image of yourself is created and you have to defeat it. If you are a Druid it will take your current form, so I always click on it while in flight form and then switch back to my normal balance form. The image stays in flight form and has very limited attacks. Makes the fight even easier.",
  "Wowhead050As a hunter, this quest is not able to be completed. I tried at least 20 times and followed the advice given here. No luck.",
},

