[91826] = {
  "9182618080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050This puzzle might be the hardest one Blizz has ever made",
  "Wowhead050Coords = 61, 68 The box is right next to her.",
  "Wowhead050Does anyone have a weakaura or addon to help with this? I am really struggling",
  "Wowhead050This quest needs you to be locked-in and hyper focused.",
  "Wowhead050I used my cognitive abilities and it still took me 35 minutes.",
  "Wowhead050Damned! I had more difficulty finding the box than solving the puzzles! :-D",
  "Wowhead050I swear to god there's no words to how dissapointed with the game this quest made me. it's downright insulting for bliz to put \"this\" in any game. a 2 year old would have no trouble with this. jesus #$%^& christ....",
  "Wowhead050It would be an insult to call it game design. Same as it's an insult to the players",
  "Wowhead050I level of excitement I had going from \"Oh cool, a new tinkering based puzzle\" to \"Oh my god this is the easiest/ dumbest mechanic Blizzard has ever implemented\" nearly snapped my neck. Is the average player 2.5 years old?",
  "Wowhead050when i finaly finished this puzzle i was drooling for hours .",
  "Wowhead050For those of you not sure how to actually interact, just right click on the one that is the answer you are wanting to go with. So if the one on the far left is spinning in the opposite direction, then just right click that single cog.",
  "Wowhead050ummm ..... How dumb does bliz think its players are? The only thing they didnt do was highlight the right cog and put an arrow over it saying 'click me'",
  "Wowhead050This is vital information. No wonder they went to such lengths to protect it. Wow. Top level security, and they know it.",
  "Wowhead050I deleted this quest and i cant figure out where to get it again..",
  "Wowhead050I legitimately thought I was being tricked/ misled at first.",
  "Wowhead050He was carrying that thing on his person? Wow. Last edited by Blackheart7 on 2026/03/10 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050This quest feels like an insult to the intelligence of the average WoW player. The fact that the cog moving in a different direction looks completely different from the other ones removes what little (and yes, it would indeed be little) \"challenge\" this puzzle would have to begin with. Who designed this quest? ChatGPT?",
  "Wowhead050I like to think I've finally found my super-savant ability that no-one else has. Otherwise, why not include an actual puzzle?",
  "Wowhead050Calling it now: Time for Blizzard/ Microsoft to launch the next monetization step - ingame ads. This puzzle could be sonsored by Brilliant dot org, they have a whole section with cogwheel puzzles (that are not three braindead clicks)",
  "Wowhead050Took me less than 30seconds to finish, so easy.",
  "Wowhead050A quest for Retridins.",
},

