[91831] = {
  "9183118080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050TO EVERYONE WHO COMPLETED THE QUEST BUT CANT HAND IT IN The issue is that you need to press 4 Pylons - NOT free 4 prisoners So after you pressed two pillars - go ahead and press the remaining two - there are four in total in the area It's an annoying bug but it will work!",
  "Wowhead050Dose anyone know were to pick up her quest if you abandon it?",
  "Wowhead050Did this Quest in a group but it's bugged in group - you have to click all 4 pylons solo. Also finished the others Quests from Valeera and turned them in before this quest. After abandoning this quest Valeera wouldn't show up again so i had to wait for a stranger to share the quest. (Thanks again to the guy from Onyixa Realm)",
  "Wowhead050I see this as an available quest on my map, but can't pick it up or get started. The questgiver isn't at the location ( / way #2437 40.4 71.6 Valeera Sanguinar) to pick it up. I don't even have any open quests to abandon to try and reset it. Totally stuck . Any ideas?",
},

[91833] = {
  "9183318080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050unlocks at level 90.",
  "Wowhead050This quest chain for a side storyline starts at Vun'zarah, the leader of the WItherbark, at 38, 22. It seems you cant start this storyline til possibly 90. Ive done this on my main, but another tool level 82 cannot see quest. But a premade 90 can. So its at least level locked to something above 82...presumably 90 since its an elite area. Given that the questline uses an ability \"Shadra's Gift\", it would be safe to assume you have to unlock Shadra (Spider from Classic Hinterlands) the Minor Loa first. The quest line for that also start in Witherbark village. Last edited by Instaggibed87 on 2026/01/04 (Patch 11.2.7)",
  "Wowhead050Dirty deeps, done dirt cheap! Dirty deeps and they're done dirt cheap!",
},

