[91927] = {
  "9192718080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Oozes are on top of mushrooms and the hill the west side of marked area. They're just tiny mobs you click on. You can / tar escaping to find them easily.",
  "Wowhead050It's very small mobs, macro below to help fast catch / tar escaping / ping [@target] Attack",
  "Wowhead050Found the oozes on the cliffs near the waterfall.",
  "Wowhead050Initially confused as to where they were, but they are all over the place on the cliffs in the marked area. They are however shared spawns, so chances are the area is empty if someone just cleaned it out.",
  "Wowhead05020 years in, and Blizzard still hasn’t learned. Shared mobs, low density, and painfully slow respawn rates. I did this at 6:00 AM PDT and the place was still packed with people doing it.",
  "Wowhead050This quest is inexcusably stupid.",
  "Wowhead050There are not many oozes and if other players do the quest at the same time as you it takes a long time.....",
  "Wowhead050/ way 60, 54 There are some cliffs that are staggered in that area. The oozes are highlighted, but if there are other players around, you may have to wait for your turn. It's annoying that Blizzard is still doing this kind of low spawn rate after all these years. It's bad enough that World Quests don't give you any information about what to do.",
  "Wowhead050Very rare and slow respawn timer",
},

