[92178] = {
  "9217818080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050I was so LOST finding this guy. Thanks to Bluewow on his video, I was able to see it. BUT, for those like me who only first looked at comments. In his main room where you accept the Prey , there is one open doorway and one blocked doorway by curtain. The doorway blocked by curtain is what you need to go through.",
  "Wowhead050Somehow today I got these quests active again after I've completed them at the start of the expantion.",
  "Wowhead050To find him, start in Murder Row. The entrance to the \"Prey\" building has two large red 'prey' stones by the door, it's facing the Meeting Stone for the Murder Row dungeon. / way 55.0, 63.4 Inside when facing the Hunt Table, go left through the red-curtain door and down the ramp. Last edited by Stompa on 2026/03/22 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Practical Magic may leave the Crystalline Vessel in your backpack, seems safe to delete after completion. It didn't leave it in my bags the first time through, but seems to have glitched and left it there after the quests reset.",
  "Wowhead050Such a missed opportunity when the Arcane Construct is imbued. You couldn't give a nod to one of your other games?",
},

