[92445] = {
  "9244518080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Once you start the questline, you need to watch the text. You will be requested to add coal, water, flux, or ... as needed. This is text base prompts only, so, need to be watching the text.",
  "Wowhead050is it bugged? i start the quest i do two things then the guy just walks back to the table and says ive failed and to try again?",
  "Wowhead050How many times do you need to do the task successfully before you complete the quest?",
  "Wowhead050Where do we turn in this completed quest ? I took the portal from Stormwind to Founder's Point as the quest said to and ended up.in Razorewind Shores with no ? To mark where to turn it in",
  "Wowhead050This type of quest is so boring, but this is a particularly poor implementation of it. And to be one of the only repeatable parts of this Endeavor, they must have been finishing it up on a Friday afternoon.",
},

