  "Wowhead050This quest (Simply Magical) turns in at Torntusk Overlook, where Lilaju (the child) is waiting for you to give you the follow-up quest, The Wisest Leaders Follow. If your main story campaign was stalled at 11/ 17 because she wasn't at the location, then this could be the fix.",
