[92505] = {
  "9250518080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Just coming from a Blizzard GM : \"Greetings Thank you for reaching out about the “A More Potent Foe” quest chain, this includes the quest Truth of the Past, from Leona Darkstrider. I completely understand how confusing or frustrating it can be when a quest chain suddenly becomes unavailable, especially when you’re eager to continue the story. This particular quest chain was designed to be time-gated as part of its intended progression. Because of that, Leona Darkstrider is not currently available to offer the chain, and this is working as designed. We truly appreciate your patience while waiting for the next portion to become available. Please be sure to check back in the future, as additional quests and updates will unlock as the content progresses.\" Sadge. Last edited by Tyleah on 2026/03/01 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050i cant see this npc... i've complete all the campain and the side quest besides this... and still cant see her...",
  "Wowhead050I have figured out whats wrong with this quest. Apparently, the quest giver should not be there after all. Because we save her in the upcoming quest series called Foothold. People who got the quest got lucky because it was bugged. Blizzard has done it again so to say.",
  "Wowhead050She isn't there for me aswell and it's the last quest line left for sojourner.",
  "Wowhead050It's March 9. I'm here with a level 90. I've completed every other quest line in Voidstorm and a bunch of other quest lines, so I can't say if something was a trigger or not. Leona is at 53.24, 70.42, sparring with another Illidari",
  "Wowhead050Still missing after official launch time.",
  "Wowhead050You should be 90 level to get this quest line",
  "Wowhead050Quest giver is now there for me when I randomly flew there",
  "Wowhead050The Cause: If you have already progressed the main campaign and completed the \"Foothold\" quest series, Leona is \"saved\" and phases out of her original location. This makes her entirely unavailable to give out the \"Truth of the Past\" side quest. I guess I am punished to have pushed the main story for steady flight. Sadge",
  "Wowhead050i was able to turn in the quest, but there is no follow up quest. (according to All the Things (Addon), there should be 2 follow up quests from Allari the Souleater) see picture -> https:// imgur.com/ a/ DxoB8Px Edit: Quest did work now, and i completed the Sojourner of Voidstorm + Loremaster of Midnight. https:// imgur.com/ a/ ncSHL9f Last edited by Tengyr on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050100% MSQ and all side quests in the zone completed, but as of right now the NPC is also missing for me. Has anyone found a solution? I tried with alts, but no luck.",
  "Wowhead050NPC Is missing for me too... Seems like a bug. I flew around the map for 2 hour straight, didn't find it...",
  "Wowhead050Looks like a lot of people can't see Leona Darkstrider . But where is she located? In The Howling Ridge?",
  "Wowhead050still missing as of 2nd march :( I opened a support ticket",
  "Wowhead050\"Thanks for freeing me from those ethereal cages in the Ethereum Overcroft.\" What on Earth is she talking about?",
  "Wowhead050No NPC for me. Sucks that I put all this time and effort into doing Loremaster only to having it prevented from being complete cause there is no NPC.",
  "Wowhead050Quest still not available after the reset.",
  "Wowhead050I completed this today. I used an alt who had not done any of the campaign in Voidstorm. I started the quest and when I got to Dark Infusion I couldn't go any further. I then did the campaign up to where you go to the Howling Ridge at which point I was able to continue the quest and finish the storyline and achievement.",
  "Wowhead050This quest line leads you to Argus to kill spirits. When I went it was being heavily farmed so I dropped the quest. If you dont see the npc but remember doing this go through the portal to argus and the follow up quest should be there.",
  "Wowhead050If you picked up the quest and abandoned it / left the area (common during early access), you (like me) may have lost track of this quest chain because the quest given immediately after this one is in another zone / xpac area. The follow-up quest The Soul Price after this one is in Argus (use your legion hearthstone). It is specifically in Eredath, near the Prophet's Reflection flight path. Easy-peasy to pick it back up from there to finish Sojourner of Voidstorm / Loremaster of Midnight. Last edited by Kewlzilbot on 2026/03/08 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Thought I was going to be slick and figure out a way for her to show up... but it didn't work. I did not have the void elf demon hunter quest complete, but it was in progress. I finished it thinking this would force her to spawn to start this quest line, but no luck.",
  "Wowhead050I can confirm the quest giver is up, was bugged previously. Sojourner is not timegated. She's kinda hard to find. Exit the portal to voidstorm and go due east. South of the inkeeper.",
  "Wowhead050I decided to level my alts through Voidstorm and do Soujourner while I was there, this was the last questline I needed but the starting NPC wasn't there. I needed to: * Get to 90 * Go to the main inn in Silvermoon and talk to Soridormi to skip the campaign that I'd already done on my main Then Leona Darkstrider showed up with the quest in Voidstorm!",
  "Wowhead050There's a good chance that you focused on the main storyline on your main character and skipped all the side quests. There's also a good chance that you saved the side quests for leveling alts. Now, you've finished all the side quests on your alt, but still can't find the quest to start the 'A More Potent Foe' portion of the Sojourner of Voidstorm achievement. That's because the questgiver Leona Darkstrider won't offer it until you advance the main storyline. To get the 'A More Potent Foe' portion of the Sojourner of Voidstorm achievement, simply log onto your character that completed the main storyline. The quest will be available and since achievement progress is linked to your warband, you'll get the Sojourner of Voidstorm achievement after finishing the quest series.",
  "Wowhead050If you don't she her, take the portal to Argus next to where she should be. You can accept the quest from her in there.",
},

[92506] = {
  "9250618080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Garbage quest design... 100+ people vying for the same 8-10 mobs... 5-10 min timers, no shared tagging. Its bad.",
  "Wowhead050How. Is. This. Still. Happening. Last edited by dvdv on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050wonderful quest in an old zone thats non sharded resullting in 100 people hunting for 8 mobs",
  "Wowhead050Appears to be bugged. No spawns. Just a bunch of people running around on their mounts looking for them.",
  "Wowhead050Absolutely the worst ever... It's like classic all over again.",
  "Wowhead050Blizzard tends to forget to turn on hypserspawning for quests in old zones. As this is the last chain many people need for Loremaster and it just opened today, there are hundreds of people farming limited mobs with long respawn times. Group together and sit around different spawn sites if you must get this done now. Otherwise, just wait for Blizz to fix the spawns.",
  "Wowhead050half the frickin server is here and the horde and superior when one did spawn after 10 minutes the horde snagged it i will come back another time this is a joke",
  "Wowhead050Blizzard is just bad. This is it. This is bad. It doesn't work, you didn't test this. WE PAY FOR THIS. THIS IS BAD. Only chance to complete this right now is to group up. Last edited by xstaindx on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050I could complete this but the npc that has the next one, Allari, just stand there and doesnt offer anything. A bunch of players around the quest giver, same problem, guess we're paying for a beta now.",
  "Wowhead050After sitting here a couple minutes, decided to check it out in war mode. Not a single person was here and all the mobs were spawned. Took two minutes at that point.",
  "Wowhead050I @#$%ing hate Blizzard man idk what to say",
  "Wowhead050the portal from voidstorm is in 53 70",
  "Wowhead050Invite people around you, done the quest in 5mns with a 5-man group :)",
  "Wowhead050This trash company never learns to not allow this *!@# to happen",
  "Wowhead050Grouping up (max 5 players) and going around the place was the best option at least for me. Took about 30 minutes to complete. Last edited by R1NN1 on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Respawn timer is currently about 7 minutes on the spirits. Last edited by RealSlimShady on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Maybe this will help someone else. / cleartarget / tar Agitated Citizen / cleartarget [dead] / cast Crackling Jade Lightning",
  "Wowhead050Poor indy company :(",
  "Wowhead050Currently the quest NPC is not active so you cannot get the quest.... I guess hte deactivated the quest to fix it?",
},

[92507] = {
  "9250718080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050So, they fixed the previous quest, but now it's impossible to take this one. Great work. Edit: Finally spawned for me. Last edited by Pyrius on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050The questline starts in Voidstorm by accepting quest Truth of the Past Last edited by Alexeinaneer on 2026/03/14 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050All quests are available now. If you have problems viewing the \"foe\" get up as close as you can to the containment ring/ domed area where the two are and you will complete the \"viewing\" part of the quest.",
  "Wowhead050If the portal is still there and the quest giver is not but it shows the question mark when you port back from Argus, fly away and come back.",
  "Wowhead050This never happened lol",
},

[92508] = {
  "9250818080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Quest log will say you need to take the portal to Silvermoon. Do not do this. go to / way 31,52 in the voidstorm Last edited by TastyDactyll on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Was running around killing alot of mobs tagged with \"Void ink\" thinking they drop the ink but you need to use the \"Void Vitae Collection\" item after you kill them. As of today 2026-03-07 it doesn't show that you collect them everytime you use it so make sure you track the quest.",
  "Wowhead050Aren't Illidari tattoos meant to contain the demon an Illidari consumed during their training? To prevent that demon from possessing the demon hunter? Seems like this queset is just downplaying it into a 'vow'.",
  "Wowhead050This quest seems like a clear reference to Berserk and the Brand of Sacrifice created by late manga author Kentaro Miura . In Berserk, the Brand of Sacrifice is a mark carved into someone’s flesh that marks them as an offering to demonic entities. Those branded are constantly hunted by dark creatures, and the mark often bleeds in the presence of evil. The quest text here strongly echoes that idea: “The tattoos that mark our flesh are more than just ink. They're a promise inscribed across our flesh… our lifeblood is a currency used to purchase Azeroth's future.” A permanent mark tied to sacrifice, blood, and holding back dark forces feels very reminiscent of the Brand’s symbolism in Berserk. Considering Blizzard’s long history of anime/ manga nods, this feels like a deliberate homage.",
  "Wowhead050Warning! If you are in a party while doing this quest - using Leona to siphon the Void Ink will only count for the person who clicks the extra action button first.",
  "Wowhead050I do not have an extra action button nor is Leona interactable to collect any void ink. Abandon/ reload does not seem to work either.",
},

[92509] = {
  "9250918080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050I saw the red flag the moment I read the quest text stating \"Defeat as many Ultradons as it takes to find the perfect implement.\" Little did I know, that'd it'd take roughly 30+ kills to get. Who designs this and goes \"Yeah... This seems like fun. They'll love flying around in circles killing the same mobs over and over and over again until it finally drops.\" If I wanted to play Classic, I'd go play classic. This is one Cruely Implemented Quest. Last edited by Diestupid on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050As of 3/ 3/ 26, the spawn rate of the Ultradon's seems terrible, and the drop rate of the quest item abysmal. edit: hotfixed apparently! Last edited by indywastaken on 2026/04/12 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead05038 kills and no drop, wtf is wrong with you Blizz",
  "Wowhead050Talon drop rate is extremely low and mob spawn rate is really low as well, what a sh*t quest. Geez Last edited by ondrovicz on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050It does drop, it took me about 10 kills to get it. I went away and did some other stuff, including handing in the other quest (The Mark of Sacrifice) and then got it on my first kill when I came back to the area. One Ultradon in each corner of the quest area. Last edited by Grawr on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050DOES INDEED DROP - TOOK AROUND 30 KILLS",
  "Wowhead050Quest log will say you need to take the portal to Silvermoon. Do not do this. Go to Nexus-Point Antius in Voidstorm. Last edited by Oceandust on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050The item needed drops from those mobs but ...there are 3 or 4 mobs in the entire zone , respawn rate is insane bad and the item needed is like 5% drop rate .. god job blizzard another W L. Last edited by Kapelput on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050part of quest - towering ultradon talon collected not work Last edited by Nydaend on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050I returned The Mark of Sacrifice quest at first and then abandoned One Cruel Implement and did that again, it dropped at first try. Maybe I was lucky, or if that works to anyone else here and the blue mark was bugged.",
  "Wowhead050As today, April 6th, 2026, I got the Talon of the Towering Ultradon after two kills!",
  "Wowhead050adds not drop quest item i kill alot",
},

[92510] = {
  "9251018080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Umbric was missing for me because I didn't progress far enough in the campaign. Need to get far enough to where you 'unlock' this base and he was there after.",
  "Wowhead050I encountered the same bug with not being able to follow Leona. This is what I observed and how I was able to fix it: If the portal is open behind Leona before you get started, it's already bugged and will not let you progress no matter how many times you try to restart it. This included relogging and flying out of the area and back - neither fixed it for me. How I Fixed: I went to Silvermoon to speak with Soridormi, but she couldn't actually help me. When I returned to the Voidstorm, I abandoned the quest and picked it back up. Everything was working on the second attempt at doing the quest from start to finish.",
  "Wowhead050So apparently, Umbric is missing again, not there to turn in the quest for me. I'm thinking I'm phased somehow because other people can still see him.",
  "Wowhead050If u still have problem with missing NPC Magister Umbric to turn in quest because you somehow broke account progress because u combined more characters, get to Silvermoon, find Soridormi / way #2393 55.6 69.8 and select skip in voidstorm. It worked for me now i can turn in quest Last edited by selmicek on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Umbric will appear. You can skip the main quest on your alts in Silvermoon by talking to Soridormi at / way 55.68 70.00 . This allows you to progress with this quest on your alt.",
  "Wowhead050umbric is not showing for me, fix this bug blizz please! Edit 16/ 17 chapter was needed, i didn't know i had to progress so much further in the campaign in order ton complete this side quest. Last edited by Aonaskull on 2026/03/11 (Patch 12.0.1)",
},

