[92546] = {
  "9254618080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Found a group of 3 at / way 34.09 62.14 Found a group of 5-6 at / way 35.99 61.52 If you see sparkles on the ground (the kind like you see when looting) click on them as well. Those are Shredclaw tracks and 1 will spawn Last edited by AdenAndrews on 2026/04/07 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050The predators don't seem to be encroaching that hard edit: it seems Blizzard has since upped the spawn rate of these guys Last edited by PeterPumpkinhead on 2026/04/10 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050If you have not finished the quest Reliable Enemies where you capture Decimus, you will be phased and won't be able to see this. You can tell if you haven't completed the quest if there are a ton of animals fighting each other in the area rather than just a bunch of void elves walking around. Last edited by SasoriRyo on 2026/03/08 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Check down the various paths leading out of the encampment. Despite the huge quest radius they're all fairly nearly the camp. Not that they're really encroaching either, most are sleeping in stealth so you need to be closeish to see them.",
  "Wowhead050Just make Target macro and fly around / Tar Encroaching",
  "Wowhead050Most will be found near the Rift base just off the pathways. They also spawn pretty quickly so travel will be not to much.",
  "Wowhead050The seem to hide in stealth. Found a pair in some of the red bushes & as well as patrolling the more flat areas. Last edited by SHSscorp on 2026/03/06 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050they are like, half stealthed, and lots of people going for them.",
  "Wowhead050I can be convinced that someone is phasing in and killing these just before I see them, pretty easily..... lol However, they are there - just fairly rare. Also, they glow.",
  "Wowhead050If you're having issues finding them it's cause you on an active Prey Hunt on that map, just Kill your prey then these mobs will apear, so will they trap triggers on the ground.",
  "Wowhead050Looked around for a while without any luck, then finally found a bunch of them at 36.26,81.82. Gathered all of them up and took them out, but there were only 6 so I had to wait for respawns to get the last 2.",
},

