[92696] = {
  "9269618080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050You can just right-click the \"buff\" off if you really don't want to wait the 5-second Knockdown stun XD",
  "Wowhead050the uprooting you need to run away with the vine to uproot. I keep standing there and nothing was happening until I realized there was a root around me. Hope this helps anyone else having isseus with the uprooting. You will also be stunned but it goes away semi fast.",
  "Wowhead050Anyone looking to turn the quest in, it's at 72.38, 55.65.",
  "Wowhead050You will be disconnected if you do the uprooting in bird form/ travel form as a druid.",
  "Wowhead050Warning: the quest is bugged on the beta (currently beta 7) Pulling up a plant stuns you, but the debuff doesn't go away (not visible on the character, even when you die) So, my character is currently softlocked as a ghost because I can't move due to the stun",
},

