[92865] = {
  "9286518080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Guys, it's simple. Just get out of your mount and the action button will appear, so you can feed the pets.",
  "Wowhead050/ reload did the trick for me, logging out might work too. Make sure you are not on your mount either.",
  "Wowhead050Once you actually need to feed the hydras next to the questgiver, you will have an extra action button to throw a bulb at a hydra.",
  "Wowhead050If you're having issues hitting F'liks, talk to him. He'll stop and be a much easier target to hit. If it doesn't give you credit that's just the quest being buggy. Just keep spamming him and it'll count.",
  "Wowhead050i mounted and dismounted, and that did the trick for me",
  "Wowhead050This quest is close to impossible, Solo Lich king level indeed. First of all, you have to dismount so the action button for feeding appears. Second..... Good luck!",
  "Wowhead050/ reload (if you understand me..)",
  "Wowhead050None of the above worked for me unfortunately. Mount / dismount, / reload, drop & redo quest: still no action button. What DID work was I created a Macro (good for Raid) to click Extra Action Button (see below), and then i clicked it a few times to try to feed the buds. UI icon showed up after clicking my macro once, and the macro worked without me having to use the UI button. Extra Action Button Macro: #showtooltip / click ExtraActionButton1",
  "Wowhead050Action button wouldn't appear no matter what (mounted, dismounted, flew away, flew back, relogged). I abandoned the quest, then picked it back up and it worked.",
  "Wowhead050This quest is pretty bugged out as of 2/ 27/ 2026. Once you collect your items and go back to the buds, relog. I did not get the additional action button until I dismounted, so try that if it still doesn't show. You may need to relog another time if you can hit them with the targeting reticle and you still don't get credit. Early Access, am I right? Last edited by Reixes on 2026/02/27 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050I couldn't hit the one that was running around at first. Even if he stood still and it clearly hit him it didn't gave me credit. Relogging didn't work, but flying away and then flying back in did work.",
  "Wowhead050I don't know why we are feeding the F'iliks one. He needs LESS food.",
},

