[93432] = {
  "9343218080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050I just about spit out my drink when I realized who these 'echoes' were supposed to be. Made all the sweeter by their frequent complaints about pulling trash, repair bills and avoiding wipes.",
  "Wowhead050Pull them one at a time! My... repair costs... Healer? HEALER? Take out the trash first! I just wanted the frog...",
  "Wowhead050\"Should have left this party months ago\"",
  "Wowhead050I love putting this quest in all my white decks.",
  "Wowhead050I had a mtg card named this",
},

[93435] = {
  "9343518080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050I was having an issue with Zungam not spawning in his correct location (inside the hut). In stead he was spawning about 150yds away but was evading every spell cast at him. The solution was to go back to Silvermoon and activate warmode, which caused him to back in his proper place and attackable.",
  "Wowhead050FFS, blizz, Harrison Jones is not dead. He's been in the game as far as BFA. How the hell do you not know your own lore?",
  "Wowhead050Harrison Jones... DEAD? What have I forgotten? OK; not heard of him since his exploits in Ashran, so I guess I missed some story about him...",
  "Wowhead050Did they seriously go the route the new Indiana Jones movie went with the \"bad man takes other cultures stuff\"? We had a whole quest line in Cata with Harrison that was an incredibly fun recreation of the RotLA scenes. I want that Blizzard back. SMDH Last edited by brothazoot on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
},

[93436] = {
  "9343618080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050And now we have come full circle, from using the amani hex stave to unhex frogs and find mojo, to hexing the ghosts left behind from the raids. I loved this bit of nostalgia.",
  "Wowhead050For hexing Rosa, set a keybind for \"Interact with Target\" - Game Menu>Options>Gameplay>Keybindings>Targeting and scroll down. Stand in the middle of where she's running (between the two posts on the dam wall), don't move, just hold your cursor roughly in the path of where she's running and spam the key.",
  "Wowhead050/ Way 8 9 Feast North West Corner Last edited by Rysh on 2026/02/27 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050The three feasts are at For Feast North West Corner. / way 8.09, 9.26 . For Feast South West Corner. / way 22.22, 80.67 . For Raider's Feast. / way 52.27, 19.27 . Warlord's Chest is at. / way 67.22, 47.50 .",
},

