[93453] = {
  "9345318080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050For those who are struggling to find Nelthius - go into the delve building where Valeera is standing and run to the back of the building. There's a ramp leading down to a lower level.",
  "Wowhead050Wow ok, none of these comments were helpful for me. Step 1 - enter the building at / way 52.07, 77.66 Step 2 - once inside the building - go down the ramp at / way 53.05, 79.16 Step 3 - Find him at / way 52.68, 77.57 Last edited by Xozus on 2026/03/21 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050You get this quest from a letter after you die in a delve. if you abandon the quest you lose the letter and cant get another one from dieing in a delve. IDK how youre supposed to get this quest again if you abandon it.",
  "Wowhead050I've just hit renown 10 with the Midnight Delver's Journey and died a few times across three toons. This quest has never popped.",
  "Wowhead050We are aware that it is not possible to start the quest again after abandoning it, and we are already investigating this issue.",
  "Wowhead050Just wanted to say this was hilarious. Grudge Pit indeed. Capitalism strong.",
  "Wowhead050To get the quest that leads to Nelthius Shadestone , A Grave Concern , you must first die in a delve. You can die in the delve after you've completed it and still get the letter to start the quest. You can choose from 2 Gravestones to begin with: Budget Friendly The Classic To get other grave marker types, you must level up in your Delver's Journey: Season 1 Rank 6, you can purchase: Sindorei Gravestone",
  "Wowhead050thank you! wasted 10 minutes running around before checking wowhead.",
  "Wowhead050I've been in two delves so far on separate occasions. This quest was sent to me in the mail by letter. It allows me to select from a nice headstone with candles or a shotty wooden one. I can click on the nice stone one, but it won't work. I have to select the wood one, it seems. Last edited by Rezzelyn 5 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
  "Wowhead050So, I'm being railroaded into a \"Budget\" funeral when I'd rather not be there at all. Nice Blizzard. Real nice.... Now, since you have this NPC in place, please add an opt-out option for this silly feature. Thanks.",
  "Wowhead050so what's the point of this quest other than receiving 3 golds? any leads to this?",
  "Wowhead050This is ANOTHER example of how lazy/ incompetent Blizzard is. They needed to add a small arrow to the quest icon that lets the player know if their quest target is above or below them or STOP putting in idiotic things like this where there's a quest directly below other NPC's. Seriously, they could have EASILY made the ramp go down at an angle AWAY from the NPCs above. Poor, poor design everywhere in this game.",
},

