  "Wowhead050So its basically raining water from the Well of Eternity under Nordrassil. The Haranir have really no clue whats going on up there in the past 10.000 years, huh? And if they drink that, then why arent they transformed into Nightelves just like the Well did to the Trolls? Last edited by Flanell 2 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
