[93889] = {
  "9388918080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Stuck on an alt. And cant finish this quest I completed the \"Fortify the Runestones\" and \"Complete two favors at the Soiree\" But for some reason I can't find a way to do \"Soiree Guests Invited\" part - I did that on another character, but on this alt the Honored guess quest wont pop in Silvermoon City (or at the Soiree Last edited by NelleRavencrest on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050If ur stuck like me and dont see the event pop up. You need to finish the quest \"honored Guests\" first Honored Guests",
  "Wowhead050The quests asks you to complete two favors. Those are the tasks given by the interlopers after you give them a coin.",
  "Wowhead050THIS specific Quest is a Weekly, like the ones that Faerin Lothar used to offer in; see Lady Liadrin in the blue-curtained gazebo next to the Bank, in Silvermoon.",
  "Wowhead050Go to the tent at 48.89 64.79 and pick up the blue quest from Lady Liadrin to to Midnight: Saltheril's Soiree",
  "Wowhead050If you don't have 2 favors to do, log into a character with favor tokens and give them to the other factions to open up two quest. Then you will see them on all your other characters.",
  "Wowhead050Anyone know where I can pick up this quest? Or is it a timed even like the Iskaara cooking event?",
  "Wowhead050This quest chain to unlock this starts with the breadcrumb Saltheril's Haven given by Saltheril in Silvermoon City 100, 66. Last edited by Llandrei on 2026/03/13 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Still bugging at 'select a guest'. I dropped and selected the quest again. It had guests, but had to redo 2 favors. Nbd Last edited by KaixAFK on 2026/03/18 (Patch 12.0.1)",
},

[93890] = {
  "9389018080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Worth noting that like most quests, this is not completable in a raid group. I got too comfortable grinding abundance through the group finder and fully did seven runs before realizing. Don't be like me.",
  "Wowhead050The follow-on quest An Abundance of Wealth can only be picked up after you are at Renown 9 with the Amani Tribe. Then it becomes available from Magovu .",
  "Wowhead050The quest says to participate in \"Zul'Aman's\" Abundance Harvest, but you can complete the Abundance eventw in any zone to get credit.",
},

[93892] = {
  "9389218080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Learned the hard way that this, like many other quests, cannot be completed while in a raid group.",
  "Wowhead050The only way I've consistently avoided this event bugging out is by arriving before it starts and staying inside the middle circle the entire time.",
  "Wowhead050Horrible, if you show up 0,1 seconds too late you can be there for THE WHOLE THING and it still doesnt count. At the same time, you might be there from the start, but you're the only one actually doing something, so you'll fail and not get anything. I *!@#ing hate this bull$%^&.",
  "Wowhead050Buggy? Prolly you NEED to FINISH this entire storyline > Go Low, Go Loud (better use BTWQuests Addon with Midnight plugin to check if or where you're at, and follow up), as pointed out by thegothmother's comment . Did questline (short one), then did entire event and got credit for WQ, got the weekly chest and 2k Singularity Rep. That begs the question: Why didn't Blizzard INCLUDE this questline in the Voidstorm ones for the main campaign? Also a TIP: BUY AND USE the Illegal Cosmic Emitter (from the Cartel broker nearby) for MASSIVE DAMAGE. Only 'use' the item WHEN you're gonna do the Event (preferably at its fullest, when you'll do the weekly). It'll give you a 60-min BUFF with an action button skill for a ST damage beam that deals a LOT of damage, but it has a CD (~10s I think). It costs 30x of the zone's currency, unless you really know how and Which defenses to drop at each point. If not, well, at least get this and preferably use it on the ELITES (specially the big Voidlord that comes at the last wave, which chews up ~30% of the Singularity's HP if not stopped).",
},

[93904] = {
  "9390418080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050This quest is in a spot called the Den of Predaxas, / way 47.9 78.7 Fly down into the opening on the ground, and you'll drop into a void pit that launches you back up. Float down through the void zones to collect the energy. There's also nodes you can harvest as well. You can drop down any time to the bottom of the pit to get launched back up. When you're done the quest, follow the path around the perimeter of the room to the top, but try to avoid the red blobs on the ground, they'll damage you. The path leads right back up to the surface. Last edited by Snowshoes on 2026/03/03 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050how do you get out of the pit without hearthing?",
  "Wowhead050So basically don't do this quest if you're a pet class, or at least not a BM Hunter. (edit: or maybe dismiss first) After jumping down into the pit my pets disappear. Don't think anything of it. I come back up and now I can't summon any pets. I've reset UI, I've changed zones, I've exited and re-launched the game. No pets. No error messages either, it just does the spell but no pet comes out. I went to a Stable Master and after putting a pet in and out of stable I was able to summon one. Then I dismissed and tried again. Nope, back to broken. So I stabled all of my pets. Grabbed a random one, and it worked. So then I grabbed my main pet, which was The Kurken. Nope, will not call. I grab Uvulos out of my stable, and he calls. I try all the other pets I had equipped at the time and they all work, except the main pet I had summoned, The Kurken. He's basically *broken* now. Last edited by pocketsVFX on 2026/03/02 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050The world quest triggers around / way 47.97, 78.56",
},

[93907] = {
  "9390718080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Bought a transmog from said vendor. Didn't give credit so i must assume it needs to be one of the \"normal\" items.",
  "Wowhead050There appears to be a typo in the quest description and goal text for the quest \"Edification of The Worthy\" , given by Propagandist Naicira <Curator of Plausible Fictions> in Silvermoon City. The current text states: \"Buy Something form Gamesmaster Fleurian\" I believe it should state: \"Buy Something from Gamesmaster Fleurian\" Bug report submitted. 😏",
  "Wowhead050Previous: Putting it Together Next: An Easy Path to Trickery",
},

