[94210] = {
  "9421018080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050\"Place the item in your chest\" ... It's a quest item. It'll be in your bags. USE the item to add it to your decor chest.",
  "Wowhead050Smugglers are in / way 62.51, 81.14 You will need to buy the Sethraliss Priest's Pillow from \"High Tides\" Ren (The Draenei) Last edited by Miliunky on 2025/11/13 (Patch 11.2.5)",
  "Wowhead050are you stuck with adding the pillow to your chest ? some addons can block the use of a questitem. instead of disabeling all addons, reload (chaos ensues!) and so on, simply drag the item onto your taskbar and use it per leftklick . the addons only block the rightklick usage.",
  "Wowhead050I completed all the required items on this quest yesterday but I can't turn it in. The quest giver is still following me around. When I click on him it says 'Have you found your forever home?' Yes, I have. Don't know where to turn from here? Last edited by kdvonclarke2 on 2025/12/04 (Patch 11.2.7)",
  "Wowhead050I had to logout/ login to advance from \"Visit the smugglers\" to \"Buy Sethraliss Priest's Pillow\". The pillow wasn't available until then.",
  "Wowhead050Pillow is sold by \"High Tides\" Ren",
  "Wowhead050Previous: Time to Decorate if you chose the Decor Tutorial or Home at Last if you chose to skip it Next: This Old Hearth Last edited by Eillesthis on 2026/02/22 (Patch 12.0.1)",
},

[94361] = {
  "9436118080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050/ way #2395 56.76 65.79 Watha'nan Crypts / way #2437 31.67 26.21 Loak'nit Den / way #2413 66.13 61.66 Floaret Grotto / way #2405 38.80 53.26 Abundant Voidburrow",
  "Wowhead050Argent Dawn EU - Seems bugged, When trying to do the skinning abundance in Zul aman killing any mobs and skinning them just gives the \"Cannot carry more abundance\" even though my bag shows 0/ 1500",
  "Wowhead050After the official release of Midnight, this is still completely bugged! But the Personal Key to the Arcantina toy was fixed within a few hours. Mind you: One is an integral part of the expansion, flagged with a pink exclamation mark. The other is some toy that was fun and useful with no harm to any other game mechanic.",
  "Wowhead050Currently bugged, abundance \"Full\" even tho bag is empty, dont waste your dundun shards.",
  "Wowhead050Still broken even after launch.",
  "Wowhead050I have the Abundant Life Quest & it shows completed for all but Watha'nan Crypts in Eversong. I just did it twice & not getting credit for it - Just did the basic one that didn't cost me dundun & it completed. Last edited by Dekky on 2026/03/10 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050wasted a dundun shard on the harandar Floaret Grotto because i trusted blizzard and didnt do my research here first. I couldn't pick up the abundance even though I'm a herbalist. At least I got 300 Unalloyed Abundance for my score of 0 out of it...",
  "Wowhead050loaknit den / skinning not working ^^",
  "Wowhead050For people who are having issues seeing this quest, you have to do The Abundant Lands (even if you've done it already on an alt). Quest is found at / way 45.05 67.62 After you do it you'll be prompted to do the tutorial again.",
  "Wowhead050loaknit den / skinning not working ^^",
  "Wowhead050Enchanting Crypt also does not work....",
  "Wowhead050Don't be in a RAID group. I felt like an idiot... Last edited by Gaara3San 8 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
  "Wowhead050Done the intro quest and unlocked the event on my paladin character, but now im unnable to see the frog in zul aman or interact/ see any other frog from the different zones. effectively blocked from doing the event on other characters.",
  "Wowhead050You should get a 3 minute timer as soon as you enter. If you don't get the 3 minute timer you are bugged from my experience. I think you get stuck inside so hearth out and come back. I got mine unbugged after many attempts by abandoning a quest before starting it.",
  "Wowhead050Azshara EU - I still cannot get a timer on any of the abundance quests/ events. (I actually checked a youtube video to understand how it is supposed to look like and yeah never seen the event timer or bar.) I have tried on 2 different days, logging in and out and trying different locations spending dundun shards and not. Seems still bugged (for some?).",
  "Wowhead050This is another \"fly away and come back\" quest. Like many other quests in recent expansions, after you finish the tutorial quest, you have to fly out of the area and then fly back before you can do the actual harvesting. This is also yet another quest series that ignores hunter abilities: Your pets cannot fetch the quest shards. If you are ranged, run straight to the alter and then just spin in circles firing to draw all the mobs to you so that as you kill them, you automatically collect and deposit the shards. Also FYI you get zero abundance for the first cave no matter how many times you run it. Last edited by Ehayen 11 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
  "Wowhead050I haven't seen the Abundance Event in Voidstorm for over a week. Is it not part of the rotation anymore?",
},

[94370] = {
  "9437018080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050If you have completed \" not what I ordered \" you will not be able to pick up this quest.",
  "Wowhead050If you're missing this quest you can simply enable party sync with a trial account alt or someone who hasn't done any quests yet and it'll appear.",
  "Wowhead050If the quest giver isn't offering this quest (as it didn't for me), go to / way 39, 61.61 and look for quests. I saw three that are associated with the Daggerspine Landing quest line required for Sojourner of Eversong Woods achievement .",
  "Wowhead050The Missing Magister quest unlocks this. This bread crumb can be skipped and Not What I Ordered can be picked up directly. The Midnight account-wide achievement unlocks this as well. You can pick up Not What I Ordered before this quest, which makes this quest disappear. Last edited by Barovian on 2026/02/28 (Patch 12.0.1)",
},

[94371] = {
