[94417] = {
  "9441718080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Why doesn't the quest tell you to just get 40 crests? You have to upgrade your gear twice.",
  "Wowhead050If your quest doesn't complete, try upgrading a blue item (usually starting at ilvl 220) with Adventurer Dawncrest twice. The Champion Dawncrest used for better gear will NOT count towards this quest. Last edited by HellCat3148 on 2026/04/01 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050This quest is completely broken. I've got hundreds of the crests, I've upgraded at least 10 items and I'm still not able to complete it. I've even dropped the quest and tried to do it again, to no avail. I believe if you've delete/ disenchanted or sold the \"Adventurer's track item\" whatever that is. That makes this quest impossible to complete as dropping, and re-accepting the quest doesn't give you another one. Another well thought out quest from Blizz.",
  "Wowhead050I have 40 crests and I can't even turn the quest in. There's a 3 hour maintenance tomorrow and hopefully they're fixing bugs because there's still a lot.",
  "Wowhead050I have finally solved the puzzle as to why we have not been able to turn this in. I'm assuming my problem is the same as yours, and that's not a safe bet. For me, I realized there's 2 criteria to this quest. I had finished the top portion (30/ 30 completed) but then underneath that it said upgrade adventurer gear. Did that twice, completed the quest and now on to Veteran Equipment quest that follows. GOOD LUCK FOLKS",
},

