[94425] = {
  "9442518080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050This seems like a lot of work compared to most world quests, but for the same reward (adventurer item)",
  "Wowhead050The NPC starting the WQ -- Scout Adaephus -- is on the roof at 49.07, 59.82",
},

[94430] = {
  "9443018080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050If you're having trouble with your items not counting towards the quest just abandon and re-take. Quest completed after taking it again.",
  "Wowhead050The quest seems bugged ? Got 2 adventurer items from WQs and it doesn't update to completed.",
  "Wowhead050Aargh the vault gave me veteran gear now I need to run lower level delves",
},

[94432] = {
  "9443218080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050If it doesn't give credit for acquiring a veteran item, do not upgrade it yet. Abandon the quest, and accept it again. Then it will give you credit for the item and you can safely upgrade it. Last edited by Hansworstus on 2026/03/04 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050Might be bugged. I have (2) veteran items. Upgraded each, cant get the \"Acquire a Veteran track item\" to trigger.",
  "Wowhead050FIXED! I abandoned the quest. Then I retook the quest. Then I immediately upgraded a piece of Veteran gear I already had on me. (cost 20 now, but already had that from 2 other Prey Hard quests) Then it immediately completed and moved onto the transmutation trade-in quest. All better now.",
  "Wowhead050Quest didn't valide the \"get veteran stuff\" part but did validate the upgrade part, so I abandonned the quest and took it again, now it's asking for 10 veteran crests.",
  "Wowhead050Like most of you, I upgraded the item first before realizing the quest hadn't given me credit for getting the item in the first place. Dropping the quest and re-taking it resulted in credit properly being given for HAVING a Veteran item, but of course I was out of crests so I couldn't get credit for upgrading again . . . Pretty frustrating. Last edited by Motoss on 2026/03/16 (Patch 12.0.1)",
  "Wowhead050So I got the quest, got a veteran item and got credit for getting one but then when I upgraded it and got credit for that, the quest forgot about me having credit for getting a veteran item. Very annoying. I only had enough veteran dawncrests for one upgrade so now I need to go earn more because the quest is stupid.",
  "Wowhead050Okay, I can confirm as of 3/ 5/ 2026 quest is still bugged. Got a piece of Veteran gear as a reward from (Hard) Prey quest and upgraded while the quest was still active and did not get any progress. Abandoned the quest, did 2 more (Hard) Prey quests to get enough Veteran currency again to upgrade and was successful in completing it. TL:dr- *Get Veteran gear *Abandon quest *Pick up quest again *Upgrade Veteran gear *Complete quest!",
  "Wowhead050Submitted this ticket & got the response below... Submitted: The quest: Veteran Equipment is not giving me credit for completing it. I have upgraded my staff: Preyseeker's Spire (Now: Item level 237 / Upgrade Level: Veteran 2/ 6) and it is not showing completed. In an attempt to fix the issue where it was showing that I had not completed either part of the quest I abandoned the quest and re-accepted it. It now shows that I have completed the requirement: Acquire a Veteran track item but not Upgrade your Veteran track item. Which have both been completed, I can’t just upgrade it again to try and just finish the quest as I spent all of my Veteran Dawncrest’s on the first upgrade that I did not get credit for. Response: A Game Master resolved your ticket, and left the following response: Hello, Customer Support does not provide game hints or restore items, currencies, or progress lost due to bugs. For common troubleshooting, please visit these resources: - Report a bug: https:// battle.net/ support/ article/ 000339262 <> / > - Common Issues: https:// battle.net/ support/ help/ article/ 000358474 <> / > - Support Articles: https:// battle.net/ support/ games/ wow <> / > - US Forums: https:// us.forums.blizzard.com/ en/ wow/ <> / > - EU Forums: https:// eu.forums.blizzard.com/ en/ wow/ <> / > - Game Guides: https:// www.wowhead.com/ and https:// www.icy-veins.com/ wow/ If you continue to experience issues, you can reopen this ticket. If you have a new or separate issue, please submit a new ticket. Make sure you complete our survey to let us know how we did. Regards, Blizzard Support",
  "Wowhead050Bugged in another way, too. Says to bring 10 Veteran Dawncrests... go to upgrade, says it needs 20. I only have 10, and none are dropping from anywhere. Yay.",
  "Wowhead050March 6th -- still bugged. I made the mistake of updating my veteran gear and I'm out of hard preys now... not sure what to do",
  "Wowhead050Still bugged. Upgraded two separate pieces of Veteran gear so far.",
  "Wowhead050Still bugged for me today after latest patch 18th March. Equipping, abandoning, retaking quest then upgrading worked as others have said.",
  "Wowhead050still bugged, would not register getting veteran gear",
  "Wowhead050Still bugged as of 3/ 21/ 26.",
  "Wowhead050Got veteran item: No credit. Upgraded the heck out of it. No credit. Abandoned and re-took quest. Now it reads: Acquire veteran itrem: (complete.) 60/ 10 veteran dawncrests. (complete.) Upgrade your veteran track item. Abandoned/ retook the quest while wearing the item. Nothing. Abandoned/ retook the quest while not wearing item, then put item on... Still nothing. I can't upgrade it, because it's already upgraded. Come on Blizz. Do better. (Meanwhile I can't complete the Great Vault, because it literally has no buttons. I'm told they'll be back next Tuesday. Seriously. I love midnight, but these kinds of bugs are just a hot mess.)",
  "Wowhead050How do I get Veteran gear? From all activities I only got Adventure gear so far.",
  "Wowhead050i have the equipment & the dawncrest. but when i press upgrade, nothing happens - there's a sound, but my item is not upgraded.",
  "Wowhead050Quest triggered on 2 of my characters when they looted a WARBOUND Veteran gear piece from a delve.",
  "Wowhead050This was bugged for me today (24th April 2026) so I came here, but before abandoning it I tried to complete it again and it allowed me. So I'm not sure if I just needed to step away from the NPC and then walk forward again (i sometimes have to do that to 'reset' an interaction), or what. But one moment the quest was marked complete but the NPC wasn't allowing me to turn it in, the next I was actually able to turn it in.",
  "Wowhead050Yup finally got 10 veterans quest and have 2 Epic helms one 240+ and one lw 230s and now going to obtain an Epic Neck from the Amani Tribe Renown Reward from doing the Abundance event you are tasked to complete so I hope they fix this and the thousand or so other issues this expansion has nad yes this is y far the worst and most buggy/ glitched launch that I have had the displeasure of playiing.",
},

