  "Wowhead050Decor Duel does NOT work for this quest. Didn't exactly expect it to, but it was worth testing since it is listed in the PVP tab.",
},

[94464] = {
  "9446418080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050For me Orweyna was above ground , overlooking the den, not inside the den itself. / way 50.90, 53.08",
  "Wowhead050Some indication within the quest as to how to get there would be super helpful. I made a Haranir to explore the new zone etc and there is zero help given as to how to go there to complete the quest.",
  "Wowhead050So I used a boost I had to level a Haranir to get this achievement. I didn't immediately get this achievement. There is a last step that you need to do on your Haranir. Once they are leveled, you need to go to Harandar. When you portal there, you just fly up through the hole in the center of the cave. Go here and talk to Orweyna, and that will give you the achievement. You have to be on your Haranir to turn this in. She is up on a ledge platform. / way #2413 50.86 53.06 Orweyna",
},

