[95373] = {
  "9537318080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050It's nebulous alright. Why is there no in-game explanation as to what you are supposed to do with this currency? I suppose they can't say in the game in so many words: \"You get a bonus roll on loot when defeating a boss\". But perhaps in the tooltip or something?",
  "Wowhead050fyi its the bonus loot rolls we have now",
  "Wowhead050Anyone who was in charge of user experience for this whole voidcore mess should go back to school. No idea what to do with the currency because the game doesn't say how I \"spend it\". Decimus offered me 3 daily quests, I accepted the first one in exchange for veteran crests. Now I had to google what to do, how do I \"spend it\" and the two other quests disappeared. So I guess I now have a bonus roll for amazing veteran gear on my main and I can't get a better bonus roll anymore? Who knows, because I certainly don't since the game doesn't tell me. edit: I got Hero gear for the bonus roll in m+. Last edited by Mortifw 18 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
  "Wowhead050Why do I have to come here to find out what the heck is and what to do with them. Where do you get this and how to do it Thanks to all who helped the rest of us out.",
  "Wowhead050Seems it's now \"working as intended\". However, that means this quest is actually doing a disservice -- do not waste these in order to fulfill the quest as you won't get them back. Just ignore this quest until you have reason to use them. Last edited by ealdrich 17 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
  "Wowhead050As far as I can tell, I did not actually spend a bonus roll with this quest. Once I turned it in, I still had 2 and 6 available. I'm sure this is to show you how to use the system, but it's nice to know that my first roll was not wasted on the crud that I got from it. I thought it might be good to add that information on the quest. I was afraid to use it since I thought it would use up one of my rolls. I hope this helps someone else. If this is incorrect, I will amend this comment.",
  "Wowhead050Alright, to dispel some of what is being said here: The quests are Account bound. Got them on my main, but I didn't have any Keys for Delves, BS we can only do 8 a week, so I switched to an alt. He already had the quests, all I had to do was purchase the Voidcores. Did a delve and when I rolled, it only used one Core, both the roll window said 1 and I still show 1 in inventory. On the roll I got Void-Reaper's Libram AND they also work with Prey: Nightmare. Just got Preyseeker's Clasp. The typical DB search only shows a Green item, I reached out to WoWhead and they said it's there, provided this: Preyseeker's Clasp ?, but, as per them, you have to do a search by Item Bonus. No matter how I formulated the search, it never brought this version up. So 2 Voidcores and I got 2 rolls Last edited by Sas148 20 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
},

