[96388] = {
  "9638818080NPCUnknown0NPCUnknown00",
  "Wowhead050Jeju refers to the female freedivers from Jeju Island, South Korea. Very cool!",
  "Wowhead050Found the relic here / way 68.54 23.62",
  "Wowhead050Ok this is a mini annoying grind. Aim ur button 2 at the fish or the fish's target area and keep shooting til the 2-3 little bit of Armour comes off them, then keep shooting till u capture it, no chasing required. While ur in under the sea grab a chest full of fish tokens. coming up for air doesnt ruin ur fishing. to travel rq u can link to a fishing hook to pul u rq thru the water but again still not necessary. 1. aim at fish's target space til their armour falls off and 2. keep shooting to capture it, 3 different groups of fish, gl Last edited by TangoTony 27 days ago (Patch 12.0.5)",
  "Wowhead050Is this thing even working? I've selected \"Suit up for a dive\" so many times and nothing has happened and the mini map still tells me to \"Speak with Depthdiver Jeju to start dive.\" @.@",
  "Wowhead050If this quest isn't working for you (doesn't even start when you click on \"Suit up for a dive\") then your quest log is likely full. Abandoning an old quest should allow you to start it. The game likely tries to add a hidden quest and can't.",
  "Wowhead050I was able to / tar a Sunken Relic.",
},

